#: includes/class-dialogue-wc-admin.php:43
msgid "This store uses Dialogue (nowdialogue.com) for product recommendations, a shopping assistant and A/B tests."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-dialogue-wc-admin.php:44
msgid "Dialogue's script sets first-party cookies (dai_v_h, dai_v_s) with a random visitor id and session id, used to recognise returning visitors and to connect orders to Dialogue visits. If the store uses a consent banner that supports the WP Consent API, these cookies are only set after the visitor allows statistics cookies."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-dialogue-wc-admin.php:45
msgid "When an order is paid, the store sends Dialogue the order number, status, totals, currency, coupon codes, the products bought (ids, names, quantities, prices), the random visitor id and whether the order was placed on mobile or desktop. Names, email addresses, phone numbers, addresses and IP addresses are not sent."
msgstr ""

